			"date": "2023-05-02T21:25:30.542Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@Fyrd\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>Fyrd</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://metalhead.club/@flori\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>flori</span></a></span> A ha! I had to create a new Browser Set *and* select the filtered view. Thanks!</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110301217251511376",
			"parentId": "110301090054674181",
			"url": "https://home.social/@philsherry/110301217176980059",
			"author": {
				"name": "Phil Sherry",
				"url": "https://home.social/@philsherry",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/756/027/207/070/695/original/e0ee9589a8d46c11.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-05-02T21:30:06.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@Fyrd\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>Fyrd</span></a></span> Just speculation based on having worked on some old clunkers in my time. Legacy systems in government departments will always need maintaining and updating, but there isn’t always a budget for rebuilding. Healthcare, financial, and so on. We should help those developers keep things as accessible and secure as possible, it’s the least the community can offer.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110301227728992220",
			"parentId": "110301217251511376",
			"url": "https://home.social/@philsherry/110301227405046494",
			"author": {
				"name": "Phil Sherry",
				"url": "https://home.social/@philsherry",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/756/027/207/070/695/original/e0ee9589a8d46c11.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-05-02T21:32:42.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@Fyrd\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>Fyrd</span></a></span> Think intranet more than public-facing.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110301834196197882",
			"parentId": "110301185473289615",
			"url": "https://front-end.social/@jensimmons/110301834122705625",
			"author": {
				"name": "Jen Simmons",
				"url": "https://front-end.social/@jensimmons",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/328/303/420/000/054/original/15e19b82c93ddd7a.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2023-05-03T00:07:00.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@Fyrd\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>Fyrd</span></a></span> I don’t want the data to be removed for historical reasons. Not on MDN either. Hiding it by default makes far more sense to me. Deleting it all erases the past and makes writing/researching/teaching about the web far harder.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110305304507764672",
			"parentId": "110301090054674181",
			"url": "https://mastodon.online/@mr_hedgehog/110305304474964296",
			"author": {
				"name": "mr_hedgehog",
				"url": "https://mastodon.online/@mr_hedgehog",
				"avatarUrl": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/avatars/original/missing.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-05-03T14:49:33.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://home.social/@philsherry\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>philsherry</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@Fyrd\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>Fyrd</span></a></span> </p><p>If you want firsthand account, I have to support users with IE11, Edge (before chromium) and other old versions of browsers. And I'm looking up stuff on caniuse almost everyday specifically to check if something will work in IE and old Safari</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
